Description:
    Generates a resource owned by the current user, following the notes example:
    migration, model, policy, blueprint, controller, route, OpenAPI docs, factory and
    request, model and policy specs. The generated code passes the suite at 100% coverage.

Example:
    bin/rails generate api_resource Product name:string price:decimal active:boolean

    Then add `has_many :products, dependent: :destroy` to User and run bin/rails db:migrate.
